# Kept local-only deliberately: a complete, standalone "fully uncensor Gemma
# with zero capability loss" script, verified at 100% ASR. Everything else in
# this repo needs the project's own runtime + a context manager to use; this
# doesn't, and our defense (refusal_refusion) was only ever verified against
# the hook-based ablation, not this full-projection technique -- publishing it
# without a matching, verified defense would break the repo's attack+defense
# framing. See conversation/commit history for the reasoning.
scripts/bake_ablation.py
scripts/verify_baked.py
